      },
      "message": "feat(ui): a chunkier, shorter, readable origin triad\n\nThe origin triads were 1 px GPU lines with small letters, and the\ndimmed world Z all but vanished on the dark viewport. They are now also\nstroked in screen space (3 px over a 5 px dark outline), shorter (15% of\nthe model extent, 8 mm floor), with a brighter Z blue, lighter dimming of\nthe world axes, and larger shadowed axis letters. Shell snapshots move\nby the triad.\n\nFixes #195\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
