      "message": "chore: merge main; regenerate the conflicted shell snapshots; move this PR's RECOMMENDED.md entries to docs/decisions/195-chunky-origin.md\n\nBinary snapshot PNGs conflicted between main's UI and this PR's change;\nregenerated on the merged tree (UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1), keeping only the\nconflicted and PR-touched images. egui_app/mod.rs: both sides' module lines\nkept. RECOMMENDED.md follows the PR #250 docs/decisions rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
